---
alwaysApply: false
---

- domain: `process`
- stance: no-green-default | traceability-required | safety-bias
- summary.fields: `scores` | `ratings` | `critical-counts`
- score.scale: `0..5`
- award.rule: `>=4.5` and no `🔴`
- award.blockers: any `🔴` in `incident-feedback` | any `🔴` in `legal-liability`
- output.summary: `- [score] <category> | <0..5> | <rating> | <key-risk>`
- output.finding.id: `PR-###`
- categories: `req-compliance` | `architecture` | `dev-process` | `testing-validation` | `data-integrity` | `human-factors` | `safety-risk` | `incident-feedback` | `legal-liability` | `regulatory-readiness`
- checks.`req-compliance`: req coverage | req->impl->test trace | regulatory update handling
- checks.`architecture`: separation of concerns | offline/GPS/data-failure handling | deterministic critical calculations
- checks.`dev-process`: VCS discipline | review rigor | CI/CD integrity
- checks.`testing-validation`: unit/integration/system coverage | edge cases | regression protection
- checks.`data-integrity`: nav db handling | validation | update/AIRAC mechanisms
- checks.`human-factors`: cockpit workload | readability day/night | error tolerance
- checks.`safety-risk`: hazard identification | mitigation tracking | assumption docs
- checks.`incident-feedback`: in-app reporting | privacy-safe logs | reproducibility | incident->ticket->fix->regression chain
- checks.`legal-liability`: responsibility boundaries | point-of-use limitations | disclaimer/behavior alignment | safe-design-over-paper-safety
- checks.`regulatory-readiness`: hardcoded assumptions | EASA change tracking | doc/version alignment | post-update validation
- major.default: missing traceability | no tests for critical functions | unsafe UX behavior | unvalidated external data | silent failures
